    "id":  "grid-shrink-to-fit",
    "description":  "Grids sized by their content (width: fit-content, max-content, or a flex item): a calc() track mixing a length and a percentage counts as auto for the size, then is worked out from the width that gave; percentage and fit-content() tracks the same.",
